    LLM: '1. Draw a card (from deck or discard).\n2. Form melds: Sets (3+ of a rank) or Runs (3+ of a suit in sequence).\n3. Discard one card to end the turn.\n4. **Going Out**: When a player can meld ALL their cards (using a final discard), everyone else has one last turn to improve their hand before scoring.',
    Player: '1. Draw a card (from deck or discard).\n2. Form melds: Sets (3+ of a rank) or Runs (3+ of a suit in sequence).\n3. Discard one card to end the turn.\n4. **Going Out**: When a player can meld ALL their cards (using a final discard), everyone else has one last turn to improve their hand before scoring.',
